<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>BSN Program Guide</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  .header-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .header-logo img { height: 60px; margin-right: 20px; }
  .header-text h1 { font-size: 36pt; margin: 0; }
  .header-text h2 { font-size: 24pt; margin: 0; }
  .section-title { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .subsection-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .list-item { margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .bold { font-weight: bold; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for UTEP Logo -->
    <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; background-color: #ccc; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 10pt;">UTEP</div>
    <div class="header-text">
      <h1>THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO</h1>
      <h2>SCHOOL OF NURSING</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">Traditional Bachelor of Science in Nursing (BSN)</h1>
  <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">Advising and Information Session</h3>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>UTEP School of Nursing – Office of Student Affairs</p>
    <p>Phone: <span data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</span></p>
    <p>Email: <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span></p>
    <p>Website: <span data-field="contact.website">{{ contact.website }}</span></p>
    <p>Location: <span data-field="contact.location">{{ contact.location }}</span></p>
    <p>Follow us on Twitter for program updates: @UTEPNursing</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">The UTEP Traditional BSN Degree Plan consists of:</h2>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt;">Phase 1 – Core Curriculum and Pre-Professional Courses</h3>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li class="list-item">Phase 2 – Nursing Courses – 1 semester, requires acceptance</li>
        <li class="list-item">Phase 3 – Nursing Professional Courses – 4 semesters, requires acceptance</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt;">Get accepted into PHASE 2</h3>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li class="list-item">Phase 2 Nursing Courses</li>
        <li class="list-item">Achieve highest possible grades in all Phase 2 Nursing Courses in order to have the best chances of acceptance to the Phase 3 Nursing Professional Courses.</li>
        <li class="list-item">Pass Criminal Background Check for TX Board of Nursing. (You will be guided through this process during Phase 2)</li>
        <li class="list-item">Health insurance coverage required to apply</li>
        <li class="list-item">Submit blood titers to compliance coordinator</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt;">Phase 2 Nursing Courses:</h3>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li class="list-item">NURS 2303—Introduction to Nurs. Practice</li>
      <li class="list-item">NURS 2407—Pharmacology for Nursing</li>
      <li class="list-item">NURS 2502—Pathophysiology</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt;">Get accepted into PHASE 3</h3>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li class="list-item">Pass drug screening &amp; complete all compliance requirements (between $500-$600)</li>
      <li class="list-item">Health insurance coverage required for clinical sites</li>
      <li class="list-item">4 semesters (between 15–24 months)</li>
      <li class="list-item">Gain approx. 900 hours of clinical experience</li>
      <li class="list-item">Become fully prepared to take and pass the NCLEX RN licensing exam</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt;">Phase 2 is a pre-requisite to Phase 3</h3>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">The University of Texas at El Paso</h2>
  <h3 style="text-align: center;">Bachelor of Science in Nursing (BSN)</h3>
  <p style="text-align: center;">www.utep.edu/nursing</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">Student Name</h3>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p><strong>Phase 1 Core Curriculum &amp; Pre-Professional Courses</strong></p>
      <p>All courses used to satisfy the core curriculum must be completed with a "C" or better.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p><strong>Application must be submitted to be considered for the nursing program—Traditional Option</strong></p>
      <p>Students are ranked for selection based on:</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Competitive Pre-professional courses GPA</li>
        <li>Competitive cumulative GPA (3.0 or higher)</li>
        <li>Successful completion of the TEAS test (62% or higher)</li>
        <li>Proof of health insurance</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

